# What this repository tracks is the pipeline: source, configuration, workflow, notebooks and
# tests. Everything below is either derived from those, obtainable elsewhere, or someone else's.
#
# The distinction that matters is not size but *provenance*. A 769 MB corpus parquet is excluded
# because `snakemake` rebuilds it from data/raw, not merely because it is large - and GitHub
# rejects any single file over 100 MB regardless, which several of them exceed.

# --- environment ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
env/
venv/

# --- third-party repositories, vendored into this tree -----------------------------------
# Complete repositories with their own licences. Clone them separately rather than
# redistributing them inside this one.
NAB-master/
OmniAnomaly-master/

# --- third-party papers ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference PDFs. Copyright is not ours to redistribute, and it is 11 MB of it.
# Note this also excludes the extracted project brief kept alongside them - move that out if you
# want it versioned.
Project Files/

# --- data --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is either a raw input obtainable from its source (see README) or an
# artifact the workflow rebuilds. `data/raw` is excluded with the rest: it is 265 MB of public
# C-MAPSS text files that are not ours to host.
data/
CMAPSS/

# Superseded covariance matrices, parked under legacy/ during the move to npz. 712 MB, and
# regenerable - the rest of legacy/ is source and stays tracked.
legacy/covariance_csv/

# --- run outputs -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rebuilt by any run. `benchmarks/` is deliberately NOT here: the TSVs are a few hundred bytes
# each and they are the evidence behind the throughput numbers, so they are worth keeping.
results/
figures/
reports/

# --- workflow state --------------------------------------------------------------------------
.snakemake/

# --- python ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- editors and operating systems -------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# --- secrets -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
